The Metal kernels in `hsd/` are written in Apple's Metal Shading Language and
compile against headers provided by the macOS SDK (`metal_stdlib`,
`metal_simdgroup`, `metal_tensor`, and MetalPerformancePrimitives, whose
`matmul2d` the prefill kernel uses). Those headers and the Metal matrix-unit
technique are Apple's; they are provided by the SDK at compile time and no
Apple source is vendored or redistributed in this repository.

